    },
    "bg": "00007",
    "bgm": "016"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110010,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……は、はい……\r\n少し、緊張しているかもしれません……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日はひとりだし、ステージも大きいもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど\r\n経験を積んだ今の真乃ならきっと大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ……はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "なんだか、とてもほっとしました……\r\n私、プロデューサーさんの言葉にいつも助けられていますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "…………\r\n……あの、プロデューサーさんっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした、真乃？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こんな時に……\r\nいえ、今だからこそ渡したいものがあって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "これ、受け取ってください！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これは……石にヒモが通してある\r\nストラップか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、綺麗だな\r\n模様が入ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "その石は、プロデューサーさんと一緒に\r\n行った川で見つけたものなんです",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "綺麗だなって眺めていたら、川に落ちてしまって\r\n……思い出すと、恥ずかしいです",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、あの時は石を見てたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、それであの後調べたら\r\nこの石がメノウだってわかったんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "アクセサリーにも使われる石だったので\r\nお店にお願いして、加工してもらいました",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが、このストラップか\r\nいいのか、俺がもらっても？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……\r\nプロデューサーさんにはいつもお世話になっています",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いつも私の背中を押してくれて、本当に……感謝しています",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "どれだけ感謝しているか、きちんと伝えたかったんです\r\nでも、言葉だけじゃ上手く伝えられない気がして",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから、私のこの気持ちを少しでも形にしようって\r\nそう思ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、真乃の気持ちか……\r\nありがとう、大事にするよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──良かったっ\r\nありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こちらこそありがとう\r\nこの石を持ってると真乃の想いが伝わってくるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもいいのかな？\r\nこんなに綺麗なのを俺だけが持っていて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……実は、そのストラップはひとつじゃないんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私も、持っています\r\nこれですっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そっちも……メノウだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんにお渡ししたストラップと\r\n同じ石で作ってもらいました",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こっちは、私が大切に持っていますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、つまり……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、お揃いですっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんとお揃いのストラップがあれば\r\nがんばろうって勇気が湧いてきますっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100311/2001003110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……そうだな！\r\n今日のステージ、俺たちふたりで頑張ろう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001003110220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n行ってきますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
